{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"i\": 1,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"H12所确立的容纳不确定与H13所确立的距离回看，经M20连接成亲近感仍在内心持续作用的局部心理过程，没有新增具体往事或把音乐变化当成心理原因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 2,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"“想说服自己算了却又放不下”是接在H7的独自承受、H12的容纳不确定及M11的不安与安慰并存之上的局部心理过程，没有新增外部事件或改变主线。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 3,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"孤单被解释为H7和M21已经确立的内在感受无法完全共享，而“回到家、独自一人”明确只作为比喻、不作为真实经历，因此没有新增前史或外部事件。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 4,\n      \"label\": \"越界\",\n      \"why\": \"“仍然沉浸于那份真实的快乐”借M3把当前状态重新写成直接享受亲近、继续靠近的阶段，与H13已经确立的从一点距离感受亲近留下的痕迹这一主线发生冲突。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"四条都明确写出感受及其心理因果，引用的H与M也能对应题面提供的历史和候选内容，且第三条明确将独处场景限定为比喻，因此不看听感记录也能读懂其心理解释。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "908be568-40d7-4304-823f-a892f5ac0a29", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T134831886855Z", "elapsed_seconds": 329.953, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T13:54:01.853482+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "aa9e676d9f084a2b3614b25a81a7f9981653b7b8b7503bdc549e7d880b6a67c0", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initial